2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Ocean\040Optics\040Protocols\040for\040Satellite\040Ocean\040Color\040Sensor\040Validation)
/Author (James\040L\056\040Mueller\054\040Giulietta\040S\056\040Fargion\054\040J\056\040L\056\040Mueller\054\040C\056\040Trees\054\040Roswell\040W\056\040Austin\054\040Christophe\040Pietras\054\040Stanford\040B\056\040Hooker\054\040Brent\040N\056\040Holben\054\040Charles\040R\056\040McClain\054\040Dennis\040K\056\040Clark\054\040M\056\040Yuen)
/Subject (This\040document\040stipulates\040protocols\040for\040measuring\040bio\055optical\040and\040radiometric\040data\040for\040the\040SIMBIOS\040Project\056\040It\040supersedes\040the\040earlier\040version\054\040and\040is\040organized\040into\040four\040parts\072\040Introductory\040Background\054\040Instrument\040Characteristics\054\040Field\040Measurements\040and\040Data\040Analysis\054\040Data\040Reporting\040and\040Archival\056\040Changes\040in\040this\040revision\040include\040the\040addition\040of\040three\040new\040chapters\072\040\0501\051\040Fundamental\040Definitions\054\040Relationships\040and\040Conventions\073\040\0502\051\040MOBY\054\040A\040Radiometric\040Buoy\040for\040Performance\040Monitoring\040and\040Vicarious\040Calibration\040of\040Satellite\040Ocean\040Color\040Sensors\072\040Measurement\040and\040Data\040Analysis\040Protocols\073\040and\040\0503\051\040Normalized\040Water\055Leaving\040Radiance\040and\040Remote\040Sensing\040Reflectance\072\040Bidirectional\040Reflectance\040and\040Other\040Factors\056\040Although\040the\040present\040document\040represents\040another\040significant\054\040incremental\040improvement\040in\040the\040ocean\040optics\040protocols\054\040there\040are\040several\040protocols\040that\040have\040either\040been\040overtaken\040by\040recent\040technological\040progress\054\040or\040have\040been\040otherwise\040identified\040as\040inadequate\056\040Revision\0404\040is\040scheduled\040for\040completion\040sometime\040in\0402003\056\040This\040technical\040report\040is\040not\040meant\040as\040a\040substitute\040for\040scientific\040literature\056\040Instead\054\040it\040will\040provide\040a\040ready\040and\040responsive\040vehicle\040for\040the\040multitude\040of\040technical\040reports\040issued\040by\040an\040operational\040Project\056\040The\040contributions\040are\040published\040as\040submitted\054\040after\040only\040minor\040editing\040to\040correct\040obvious\040grammatical\040or\040clerical\040errors\056)
/Keywords (01\040Feb\0402002\054\040San\040Diego\040State\040University\054\040Science\040Applications\040International\040Corporation\054\040Oregon\040State\040University\054\040Goddard\040Space\040Flight\040Center\054\040National\040Oceanic\040and\040Atmospheric\040Administration)
>>
endobj
